# GitHub Personal Access Token used to call the GitHub Models API.
# This powers the AI chatbot on the portfolio website via your Copilot subscription.
#
# How to create the token:
#   1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens/new (fine-grained PAT)
#   2. Under "Permissions" → "Account permissions", grant "Models" → "Read-only"
#      (this is the narrowest scope — it only allows model inference, nothing else)
#   3. Copy the generated token and paste it below
#
# ⚠️  Security note: this token is bundled into the client-side JS bundle.
#    Using a fine-grained PAT with ONLY "models:read" keeps the blast radius
#    minimal if the token is ever discovered.  Rotate it whenever needed.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your token:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here
